{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmgdVLNx2tAWootidYaN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm stopping here, after five screens. It's black, it's full of numbers, and my eyes have had enough.\n\n**What I'd tell my son:** I didn't decide anything. I'll ask you, or the bank. I'm not very sure what I saw. The page lists 105 products and 96 tracks for Harel (\"כל המוצרים 105\", \"96 מסלולים ב־7 מוצרים\"). It's far too much for me.\n\n**What I understood:**\n- There's a fee \"מההחיסכון\" of about half a percent, between \"0.41%\" and \"0.67%\". Next to it is a second fee \"מההפקדות\", which is \"0%\" in most rows.\n- I don't know what my bank takes, so I can't tell you whether this is more or less.\n- In most rows the returns just say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", with no number. Where there is a number, it's like \"13.7%\" for something called \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\", with \"99%\" shares. That isn't for me.\n- The only thing that sounded like my money was \"כספי (שקלי)\": 4.25% over 3 years and 3.08% over 5 years.\n- \"אג\"ח סחיר\" sounds safe, but it shows no return. \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" again.\n- Nowhere did it say whether any of this is as safe as a deposit.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The top with the name הראל and the row of product buttons.\n2. קופת גמל להשקעה.\n3. קרן השתלמות.\n4. The start of תגמולים ואישית לפיצויים.\n\nI didn't reach the rest. Lower down there were product names I only saw on the buttons: קרן פנסיה חדשה, חיסכון לכל ילד, קרנות סל.\n\n**Words I didn't understand:**\n- \"S&P 500\", \"עוקב מדדים\", \"גמיש\", \"סחיר\", \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח\", \"מסלול\", \"קופה\" with those long numbers\n- \"הלכה יהודית\", \"קיימות\"\n- \"123 מקורו / 123 מחושב\"\n- \"עוד לא דווח\" with a little orange mark\n\nI also didn't understand the coloured circles. The yellow and the light blue look almost the same to me.\n\n**What I couldn't read:** The grey notes under the column headings. The little \"?\" 